# The Grafizum sync config names every repo on this machine and is passed the
# GRAFIZUM_SYNC_KEY on the command line, so it stays out of git. Recovered from
# C:\Temp\sync.config.json on the old Windows SSD; upstream it lived outside the
# repo entirely, in the Windows Temp folder.
sync.config.json

